n eigenen Verbündeten schießen.","text":"Es steht unentschieden, und Ieyasu verliert die Geduld mit dem Mann auf dem Berg. Er lässt seine Arkebusiere auf Kobayakawas Stellung feuern – auf einen Verbündeten, der noch nicht Verbündeter ist. Der Schuss ist eine Frage: Auf welcher Seite stehst du? Kobayakawa hat eine Viertelstunde, sie zu beantworten.","stellungen":[{"id":"w-kobayakawa","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.469,35.35889],[136.47226,35.35667],[136.47449,35.35429],[136.47458,35.35087],[136.47064,35.34984],[136.4669,35.3488],[136.46381,35.35106],[136.46425,35.35418],[136.46481,35.35757]],"name":"Kobayakawa · unter Beschuss","staerke":"15.600"},{"id":"o-schuss","partei":"ost","form":"pfeil","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4738,35.369],[136.4715,35.36],[136.47,35.356]],"name":"Ieyasus Arkebusiere"},{"id":"w-ishida","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.45272,35.37638],[136.45231,35.37811],[136.44922,35.37902],[136.44754,35.37791],[136.44428,35.37062],[136.44469,35.36889],[136.44778,35.36798],[136.44946,35.36909]],"name":"Ishida","staerke":"5.000"},{"id":"w-ukita","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4665,35.36583],[136.46603,35.36785],[136.46225,35.36897],[136.46029,35.36768],[136.4565,35.35917],[136.45697,35.35715],[136.46075,35.35603],[136.46271,35.35732]],"name":"Ukita","staerke":"16.000"},{"id":"w-otani","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46787,35.35918],[136.46784,35.36064],[136.46467,35.36214],[136.4631,35.36142],[136.45913,35.35582],[136.45916,35.35436],[136.46233,35.35286],[136.4639,35.35358]],"name":"Ōtani","staerke":"5.000"},{"id":"o-fukushima","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46228,35.36092],[136.4627,35.35919],[136.46578,35.35828],[136.46746,35.35939],[136.47072,35.36668],[136.4703,35.36841],[136.46722,35.36932],[136.46554,35.36821]],"name":"Fukushima","staerke":"5.500"},{"id":"o-ieyasu","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4735,35.37644],[136.47649,35.3744],[136.47854,35.37222],[136.47861,35.36909],[136.475,35.36814],[136.47158,35.36719],[136.46874,35.36926],[136.46914,35.37213],[136.46966,35.37523]],"name":"Ieyasu","staerke":"30.000"}]},{"zeit":"12 Uhr","t":660,"kurz":"Der Berg kommt herunter – auf die eigene Flanke.","text":"Kobayakawa lässt seine 15.600 Mann den Westhang hinabgehen, auf Ōtani Yoshitsugu. Ōtani hat mit dem Verrat gerechnet und seine Front nach Süden gedreht; er hält den ersten Stoß. Dann wechseln vier weitere Herren der Westarmee, die neben ihm stehen, ebenfalls die Seite. Gegen fünf Gegner auf einmal hilft keine Vorsicht.","stellungen":[{"id":"o-kobayakawa","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.45972,35.35968],[136.45791,35.35786],[136.45953,35.35422],[136.46236,35.35378],[136.47428,35.35732],[136.47609,35.35914],[136.47447,35.36278],[136.47164,35.36322]],"name":"Kobayakawa · übergelaufen","staerke":"15.600"},{"id":"o-verrat","partei":"ost","form":"pfeil","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4685,35.3545],[136.466,35.357],[136.464,35.3585]]},{"id":"w-otani","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46738,35.35635],[136.46874,35.35731],[136.46811,35.36025],[136.46643,35.36077],[136.45862,35.35965],[136.45726,35.35869],[136.45789,35.35575],[136.45957,35.35523]],"name":"Ōtani · Front nach Süden","staerke":"4.500"},{"id":"w-ukita","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4665,35.36583],[136.46603,35.36785],[136.46225,35.36897],[136.46029,35.36768],[136.4565,35.35917],[136.45697,35.35715],[136.46075,35.35603],[136.46271,35.35732]],"name":"Ukita","staerke":"15.000"},{"id":"w-ishida","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.45272,35.37638],[136.45231,35.37811],[136.44922,35.37902],[136.44754,35.37791],[136.44428,35.37062],[136.44469,35.36889],[136.44778,35.36798],[136.44946,35.36909]],"name":"Ishida","staerke":"5.000"},{"id":"o-fukushima","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46128,35.36092],[136.4617,35.35919],[136.46478,35.35828],[136.46646,35.35939],[136.46972,35.36668],[136.4693,35.36841],[136.46622,35.36932],[136.46454,35.36821]],"name":"Fukushima","staerke":"5.500"},{"id":"o-ieyasu","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.4735,35.37644],[136.47649,35.3744],[136.47854,35.37222],[136.47861,35.36909],[136.475,35.36814],[136.47158,35.36719],[136.46874,35.36926],[136.46914,35.37213],[136.46966,35.37523]],"name":"Ieyasu","staerke":"30.000"}]},{"zeit":"13 Uhr","t":720,"kurz":"Ōtani fällt, und die Linie rollt sich auf.","text":"Ōtani Yoshitsugu, seit Jahren von einer Krankheit erblindet und in einer Sänfte geführt, lässt sich das Ende melden und nimmt sich das Leben. Mit seinem Flügel gibt es keine Südflanke mehr. Der Rest der Westarmee wird von der Seite aufgerollt – erst Ukita, dann Konishi, dann Ishida.","stellungen":[{"id":"w-otani","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46612,35.35712],[136.46707,35.3578],[136.46653,35.3603],[136.46535,35.36066],[136.45988,35.35988],[136.45893,35.3592],[136.45947,35.3567],[136.46065,35.35634]],"name":"Ōtani · vernichtet","staerke":"1.000","geschlagen":true},{"id":"o-kobayakawa","partei":"ost","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.45722,35.36218],[136.45541,35.36036],[136.45703,35.35672],[136.45986,35.35628],[136.47178,35.35982],[136.47359,35.36164],[136.47197,35.36528],[136.46914,35.36572]],"name":"Kobayakawa","staerke":"15.000"},{"id":"w-ukita","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.46557,35.36464],[136.46634,35.36644],[136.46363,35.36907],[136.46132,35.36877],[136.45343,35.36336],[136.45266,35.36156],[136.45537,35.35893],[136.45768,35.35923]],"name":"Ukita · in der Zange","staerke":"10.000","geschlagen":true},{"id":"w-ishida","partei":"west","form":"flaeche","gattung":"fuss","punkte":[[136.45258,35.37607],[136.4522,35.37766],[136.44894,35.37863],[1